The IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono woff2 files in this directory are
subsets of IBM Plex, © 2017 IBM Corp., licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1.

Upstream: https://github.com/IBM/plex
License:  https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

The subsets were taken from Google Fonts (latin and latin-ext ranges only)
and are served from /static/fonts/ so the site loads no third-party assets.
